18e9922680b1fac615c6916fae64953da21a0eab284a6","qualification":"合併前來源限定人物label/status/historicity逐值保留；非對現役人物資格的改寫。"}],"rationale":"齊王母家駟鈞惡戾虎冠，與提要暴戾/京師弗許直接橋。 僅辨同一來源人物，保原字、篇題引用、人名錨及頻次；不由此新增親屬或紀年。","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p010","text":"齊王既聞此計，乃與其舅父駟鈞、郎中令祝午、中尉魏勃陰謀發兵。齊相召平聞之，乃發卒衛王宮。魏勃紿召平曰：「王欲發兵，非有漢虎符驗也。而相君圍王，固善。勃請為君將兵衛衛王。」召平信之，乃使魏勃將兵圍王宮。勃既將兵，使圍相府。召平曰：「嗟乎！道家之言『當斷不斷，反受其亂』，乃是也。」遂自殺。於是齊王以駟鈞為相，魏勃為將軍，祝午為內史，悉發國中兵。使祝午東詐瑯邪王曰：「呂氏作亂，齊王發兵欲西誅之。齊王自以兒子，年少，不習兵革之事，願舉國委大王。大王自高帝將也，習戰事。齊王不敢離兵，使臣請大王幸之臨菑見齊王計事，并將齊兵以西平關中之亂。」瑯邪王信之，以為然，（西）［迺］馳見齊王。齊王與魏勃等因留瑯邪王，而使祝午盡發瑯邪國而并將其兵。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m010-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"齊王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ABA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m010-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"駟鈞","kind":"person","person_id":"upt_y7g_i6w","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m010-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"祝午","kind":"person","person_id":"fgr_573_f18","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m010-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"魏勃","kind":"person","person_id":"wse_abc_uqy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m010-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"召平","kind":"person","person_id":"mjm_mzj_yye","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m010-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"魏勃","kind":"person","person_id":"wse_abc_uqy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m010-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"召平","kind":"person","person_id":"mjm_mzj_yye","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m010-0066","start":66,"end":68,"surface":"相君","kind":"person","person_id":"mjm_mzj_yye","status":"contextual_provisional","note":"集體、未名者、未核官稱或代詞，不補姓名及家屬成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m010